      "thoughtfullyOrganizedSurahsForDifferent": "Suuraaleen yeroo fi mata-duree garaagaraaf ofeeggannoodhaan gurmaa'an",
      "weCareAboutTheAccuracy": "Sirrummaa qabiyyee qulqulluu, dizaayinii ulfina qabuu fi argannoo amanamaa ni eegna. ISTIMA nama itti fayyadamaniif of eeggannoodhaan fooyyessuu itti fufna. Rabbiin carraaqqii kana haa fudhatu, dhaggeeffatu, dubbisu fi yaadu hundaaf bu'aa qabeessa haa godhu."
